'cdsByTx' isn't used in this context in VariantAnnotation 1.1.61, which 
has two lines like

    cdsCO <- countOverlaps(query, cache[["cdsByTx"]], type="within")
    txFO <- findOverlaps(query, cache[["tx"]], type="within")

that might be the current implementation. This line

   cdsFO <- findOverlaps(queryAdj, cdsByTx, type="within")

_is_ in VariantAnnotation 1.0.5; I think you are getting the wrong 
version of VariantAnnotation, but this is not consistent with your 
sessionInfo().

Martin


