From: anders at embl.de (Simon Anders)
Date: Wed, 14 Mar 2012 08:41:12 +0100
Subject: [BioC] edgeR i get 377 significant genes where in DESeq i got 0
In-Reply-To: <Pine.WNT.4.64.1203141004220.5712@PC765.wehi.edu.au>
