Subject: [BioC] edgeR-How to obtain a list of normalized expression
	values
In-Reply-To: <0B997692-95F1-45CD-9A15-28A748B0CE73@uni-duesseldorf.de>
References: <0B997692-95F1-45CD-9A15-28A748B0CE73@uni-duesseldorf.de>
Message-ID: <1331902912.4378.YahooMailNeo@web86702.mail.ird.yahoo.com>

Hi Philipp

For normalised counts on the log2 scale do:


effective.lib.size <- d$samples$lib.size * d$samples$norm.factors
y <- log2( t(t(d$counts+0.5) / (effective.lib.size+0.5)) )

Best

iain



