I wonder if there is a libtabix.a already under /usr/local/lib

find /usr/local/lib -name libtabix.a

and if it does not have ti_conf_sam (test via nm and grep)?

Also, I do not have immediate access to gcc 4.6, which appears to be the 
version you're using?

